  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Since&nbsp;the graphs do not intersect,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, the least integer value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>",
